WEBVTT

00:53:29.199 --> 00:53:31.115
when someone who we love goes,

00:53:31.139 --> 00:53:33.209
is to carry them forward.

00:53:33.233 --> 00:53:34.589
Of course they will live on.

00:53:34.613 --> 00:53:36.235
We're all connected to each other.

00:53:36.259 --> 00:53:37.418
EG: Everything lives on.

00:53:37.442 --> 00:53:40.382
CA: Everything lives on. Right.
Everything has consequence.

00:53:40.406 --> 00:53:45.341
And so there is a way, I think,

00:53:45.365 --> 00:53:49.043
to sort of celebrate that and to own that

00:53:49.067 --> 00:53:52.101
and take with you, "I will be
inspired every day by this person,

00:53:52.125 --> 00:53:54.585
even though I can't actually hug them."

00:53:54.609 --> 00:53:56.782
EG: You see the world
through a Zoe filter.

00:53:56.806 --> 00:53:57.963
CA: Yeah.

00:53:57.987 --> 00:54:00.048
EG: I see the world
through a Rayya filter,